# 仓库里全是源代码和文档：统一按 LF 存，避免 Windows 上的 CRLF 到处 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本必须保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不要做换行转换，diff 时也不要当文本看
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary

# 文档、清单与脚本
*.md text diff=markdown
*.json text
*.yml text
*.mjs text
*.js text

# 语言统计（GitHub 语言条）不把文档截图算进去
docs/images/** linguist-documentation
